{"channelId":"UCQ0EpvC5PcI8_4DlNplGGuw","row":["Lancaster Farm Sanctuary",396,"Lancaster Farm Sanctuary is a 501(c)(3) non-profit farmed animal sanctuary.\n\nLFS is an LGBTQ-founded and led organization. It is the mission of LFS to rescue farmed animals and provide them with sanctuary and inspire humans to live with compassion and respect. The purpose of LFS is to reduce animal suffering and lead humanity to a kinder and more sustainable future by connecting the seemingly disparate, but deeply connected issues of animal exploitation, social injustice, failing human healthcare, and environmental degradation. By connecting with individuals, educating the general public, and collaborating with local organizations, LFS models the change necessary to improve the lives of community members, human and nonhuman alike. \n\nOur core values: Justice, Integrity, Compassion, Responsibility, and Courage","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ0EpvC5PcI8_4DlNplGGuw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ0EpvC5PcI8_4DlNplGGuw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:07.995Z","channelId":"UCQ0EpvC5PcI8_4DlNplGGuw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"05783af1f8cb35906c44a9e2185728c3418b37b98ce4c105c4ed08b83d5a90ca","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"abe8a9341f816497e3a180423bbf30ce203df2688741dc7b40654ba7e845f48f"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ0EpvC5PcI8_4DlNplGGuw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:03:13.942Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ0EpvC5PcI8_4DlNplGGuw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":396,"raw":"396 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ0EpvC5PcI8_4DlNplGGuw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:07.995Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://lancasterfarmsanctuary.org/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:35:24.625Z"},{"url":"https://lancasterfarmsanctuary.org